{"2875640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "My Corp Cargo Simulator : Prologue", "steam_appid": 2875640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· You've built a cargo company from scratch. Your only chance is to be the only delivery driver in town. Everyone is eagerly awaiting you. Since you can't afford employees, you have to rush through every job yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875640/extras/56f5329cf4a27c9e7c63b7078563e02a.avif?t=1784804645\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· The people in this town don't even know you yet. Will you overcharge them, or will you be a good manager?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875640/extras/72ebad9ba96fa76a3dfb8b910c38ca9d.avif?t=1784804645\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· People have left you so many shipments that you've run out of space in your office, so you've bought a new shelf! If you're curious about more, download and play the game! It's free, after all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875640/extras/2b62792fb214859d98083b50aa71653b.avif?t=1784804645\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· You've built a cargo company from scratch. Your only chance is to be the only delivery driver in town. Everyone is eagerly awaiting you. Since you can't afford employees, you have to rush through every job yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875640/extras/56f5329cf4a27c9e7c63b7078563e02a.avif?t=1784804645\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· The people in this town don't even know you yet. Will you overcharge them, or will you be a good manager?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875640/extras/72ebad9ba96fa76a3dfb8b910c38ca9d.avif?t=1784804645\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· People have left you so many shipments that you've run out of space in your office, so you've bought a new shelf! If you're curious about more, download and play the game! It's free, after all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875640/extras/2b62792fb214859d98083b50aa71653b.avif?t=1784804645\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Start and grow your own cargo company! Make fast and reliable deliveries to your customers on foot, bicycle, and motorcycle. Grow your business by making strategic decisions. Build your cargo empire in this simulation game that will make you feel like a real entrepreneur.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Dutch<strong>*</strong>, Arabic<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875640/header.jpg?t=1784804645", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875640/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784804645", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/287564